# Supabase password-reset redirect

When Connor mentions an official/custom domain, DNS, go-live, or Vercel production URL, remind him once:

In Supabase → Authentication → URL Configuration → Redirect URLs, add:

`https://THE-DOMAIN/auth/callback`

Forgot-password flow: Forgot password? → email → Supabase sends the link → `/auth/callback` → `/portal/update-password`. No separate email API.

Local already needs `http://localhost:3001/auth/callback`. Do not nag every turn; only when a real domain comes up.
